    "recommendations": "Ensuring that the front driveway and access road remain clear of parked vehicles and other obstructions could improve apparatus approach and turnaround capability, particularly given the single access point and extended driveway length. Displaying a clearly visible address marker near the driveway entrance would support navigation and reduce response delays. Maintaining separation between dense vegetation and both structures could facilitate personnel movement around the buildings and improve visibility during operations. Identifying and communicating an alternative rear access route to local responders in advance may assist crews during incidents requiring multi-point deployment across the property."
